### About `color`

A `#RRGGBB` value always works. A color *name* only works if `resolve_opencode_color()` in `scripts/convert.sh` knows it — anything else is silently rewritten to grey in the OpenCode integration. `scripts/lint-agents.sh` reads that list straight out of the converter, rejects a name not in it, and prints the allowed names.

